    {
      "fileName": "ancestral-longevity.json",
      "id": "WoLh16gyDp8y9WOZ",
      "name": "Ancestral Longevity",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "WoLh16gyDp8y9WOZ",
        "folder": "8RK49w67qc7pkvn1",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Ancestral Longevity",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have accumulated a vast array of lived knowledge over the years. During your daily preparations, you can reflect upon your life experiences to gain the trained proficiency rank in one skill of your choice. This proficiency lasts until you prepare again. Since this proficiency is temporary, you can't use it as a prerequisite for a skill increase or a permanent character option like a feat.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "at least 100 years old"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "alwaysActive": true,
              "key": "RollOption",
              "option": "ancestral-longevity",
              "phase": "beforeDerived",
              "suboptions": {
                "config": "skills",
                "predicate": [
                  "skill:{choice|value}:rank:0"
                ]
              },
              "toggleable": true
            },
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "upgrade",
              "path": "system.skills.{item|flags.system.rulesSelections.ancestralLongevity}.rank",
              "phase": "beforeDerived",
              "priority": 60,
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "elf"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "elven-lore.json",
      "id": "zki5qdM5IQcAiscM",
      "name": "Elven Lore",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "zki5qdM5IQcAiscM",
        "folder": "8RK49w67qc7pkvn1",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Elven Lore",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've studied traditional elven arts, learning about arcane magic and the world around you. You gain the trained proficiency rank in Arcana and Nature. If you would automatically become trained in one of those skills (from your background or class, for example), you instead become trained in a skill of your choice.</p>\n<p>You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Additional Lore] general feat for Elf Lore.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "upgrade",
              "path": "system.skills.arcana.rank",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "upgrade",
              "path": "system.skills.nature.rank",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "key": "GrantItem",
              "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Additional Lore"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "elf"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "elven-weapon-familiarity.json",
      "id": "4NKyZVkmWjDyyIYZ",
      "name": "Elven Weapon Familiarity",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "4NKyZVkmWjDyyIYZ",
        "folder": "8RK49w67qc7pkvn1",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Elven Weapon Familiarity",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You favor bows and other elegant weapons. You gain access to all uncommon weapons with the elf trait. You have familiarity with weapons with the elf trait plus @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Longbow]{Longbows}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Composite Longbow]{Composite Longbows}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Rapier]{Rapiers}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Shortbow]{Shortbows}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Composite Shortbow]{Composite Shortbows}—for the purposes of proficiency, you treat any of these that are martial weapons as simple weapons and any that are advanced weapons as martial weapons.</p>\n<p>At 5th level, whenever you get a critical hit with one of these weapons, you get its critical specialization effect.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "definition": [
                {
                  "or": [
                    {
                      "and": [
                        "item:trait:elf",
                        "item:category:martial"
                      ]
                    },
                    "item:base:longbow",
                    "item:base:rapier",
                    "item:base:shortbow"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "key": "MartialProficiency",
              "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.MartialProficiency.MartialElfWeapons",
              "sameAs": "simple",
              "slug": "martial-elf-weapons"
            },
            {
              "definition": [
                "item:trait:elf",
                "item:category:advanced"
              ],
              "key": "MartialProficiency",
              "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.MartialProficiency.AdvancedElfWeapons",
              "sameAs": "martial",
              "slug": "advanced-elf-weapons"
            },
            {
              "key": "CriticalSpecialization",
              "predicate": [
                {
                  "gte": [
                    "self:level",
                    5
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "or": [
                    "item:trait:elf",
                    "item:base:longbow",
                    "item:base:rapier",
                    "item:base:shortbow"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "elf"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
